# Trading Modes
Rule Type: Always

## Mode Requirements
### Backtest Mode
- Use historical data
- Validate against past performance
- Log all signals
- Track performance metrics
- Document results

### Watch Mode
- Use real-time data
- Validate against backtest
- Log all signals
- Compare with backtest
- Monitor performance

### Realtime Mode
- Use live market data
- Execute real trades
- Log all operations
- Monitor execution
- Track performance

## Mode Consistency
### Shared Requirements
- Identical entry/exit logic
- Same signal generation
- Consistent risk management
- Uniform position sizing
- Common error handling

### Mode-Specific Requirements
